}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000037",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Das “Niveau” ist eine “Informationseinheit”. \nSie bezeichnet eine Kategorisierung des Ausmaßes der Ausprägung eines oder mehrerer bestimmten Merkmale. \nIm Bildungskontext bezeichnet das “Niveau” das Level, die Komplexität, die Tiefe oder den Schwierigkeitsgrad eines Lerninhalts oder einer Kompetenz, die in einem Lehrplan oder Bildungsstandard festgelegt ist.\nDas Niveau gibt an, welche Anforderungen in Bezug auf Wissen, Fähigkeiten und Fertigkeiten an Lernende gestellt werden und kann sich in Anforderungsbereiche, Bildungsgang-, Fach-  und Fremdsprachenniveau differenzieren. \nEs drückt nicht aus, in welcher Jahrgangs- oder Schulstufe sich die Lernenden befinden."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The \"Niveau\" is an “information content entity”.\nIt denotes a categorization of the extent to which one or more specific characteristics are expressed.\nIn the educational context, the \"Niveau\" refers to the level, complexity, depth, or degree of difficulty of a learning content or a competence defined in a curriculum or educational standard.\nThe \"Niveau\" indicates the requirements placed on learners in terms of knowledge, skills, and abilities, and can be differentiated into areas such as levels of demand, educational track level, subject level, and foreign language level.\nIt does not indicate the grade or school level of the learners."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Niveau"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "niveau"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000038",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000069"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0001105"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Gymnasialniveau Sek I (HB)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000039",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A \"Bistafach\" is a \"Schulfach\" for which the KMK has published \"Bildungsstandards\".\nThe \"Bistafächer\" are German, mathematics, the first foreign language (English or French), and the three natural sciences: biology, chemistry, and physics."
  }, {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Ein “Bistafach” ist ein “Schulfach”, zu dem es von der KMK veröffentlichte\nBildungsstandards gibt. Die Bistafächer sind Deutsch, Mathematik, die erste Fremdsprache (Englisch oder Französisch) und die drei Naturwissenschaften Biologie, Chemie und Physik."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "BistaFach"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000001"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid68"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000040",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Class of the designations of the German federal states whose ministries of education and cultural affairs are responsible for the curricula."
  }, {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Klasse der Bezeichnungen der deutschen Bundesländer, deren Kultusministerien für die Lehrpläne zuständig ist."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Bundesland Bezeichnung"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "state designation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid76"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000041",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has unit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "hat Einheit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000043",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Die “Oberstufenphase” ist eine Informationseinheit, die die Phase der Sekundarstufe II beschreibt. Sie umfasst die Einführungs- und die Qualifikationsphase der gymnasialen Oberstufe, welche die Schülerinnen und Schüler systematisch auf das Abitur (Allgemeine Hochschulreife) vorbereitet – beginnend mit der fachlichen Einführung bis hin zur prüfungsrelevanten Qualifikation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Oberstufenphase"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "secondary phase"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000044",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000069"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000832"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000834"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0001105"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Oberschulniveau (HB)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "gilt für die Jahrgangsstufen 5-6"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000026" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_2000005"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_2000006"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000045",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000020"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Sekundarbereich I"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Sekundarstufe I"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000046",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000050"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000051"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000052"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000055"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000020"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Ist eine Schulstufe des Gymnasiums, die aber auch an anderen Schularten eingerichtet werden kann. Sie deckt die Jahrgangsstufen 11-13 oder 10-12 ab, je nach Land und Schulart. (Allgemeinbildender Bildungsgang mit Abiturprüfung als Abschluss, der zur Allgemeinen Hochschulreife führt.)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Sekundarbereich II"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Gymnasiale Oberstufe"
  }, {
    "@language" : "de",
    "@value" : "Sekundarstufe II"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/lehrplan/ontology/LP_0000047",
